1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Does anyone have an interesting story to tell?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le16ob08re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le16ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le16ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le16ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "I have never shared this story with anyone. It has shaken me and left me with nightmares. As I walked home along the bank of the Irondale river, something strange happened. It was after 8 p.m. and I&rsquo;d had a stressful day at work. Everything was quiet and there was a full moon. A party had been organized by my friends at a local pub but I had arrived too late. I sat on some large rocks very close to the water&rsquo;s edge and contemplated my life. &nbsp;Feeling lonely and tired, &nbsp;I closed my eyes and after a few minutes, I fell asleep.<br/>", "id": 1}, {"time": "39000", "image": "engenn8le16ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "When I woke up, the weather had changed and it had become very dark and cold. I rubbed my eyes to wake up but felt disoriented. &nbsp;Suddenly, I heard a splash. &nbsp;What I saw in the murky water was terrible and frightening, and unlike anything I&rsquo;d ever seen before. Slowly, a dark figure began to emerge from the water. I was paralysed by the shocking site. The menacing, faceless animal moved closer and started to extend his arms to latch onto my legs. &nbsp;<br/>", "id": 2}, {"time": "78000", "image": "engenn8le16ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "From nowhere, someone appeared on the rocks next to me. He was wearing strange clothing and had a crazy look in his eyes. He shouted, &ldquo;Get back, beast from the darkness!&rdquo; &nbsp;With a bright flash, the monster hissed and disappeared under the rippling waters. &ldquo;Never fall asleep by the river when there&rsquo;s a full moon&rdquo;, he said, &ldquo;The Moon Silths will get you&rdquo;. He vanished in a flash of light. I have been terrified of the river ever since.<br/>\n&nbsp;<br/>\nWhat on earth was a Moon Silth and who was the mysterious man? I stumbled to my feet, glanced at the moon and scurried home.<br/>", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "5000", "image": "", "text": "Writing A Narrative", "id": 1}, {"time": "6000", "image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">The passive voice</span>", "id": 2}, {"time": "98000", "image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">The simple past and present perfect tenses</span>", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn8le16ob08re3vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Strange Coincidences"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Let Me Tell You a Story"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes well-organized texts or articles about explaining the rules and regulations in his/her industry using appropriate grammar, vocabulary, spelling coherence and cohesion, and different levels of formality."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le16ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing a Short Narrative"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected to the present in some way. <br/><br/>You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished action or event <span class=\"strong\">not</span> necessarily connected to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about experience.<br/>When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "To help you decide whether you should use the Present Perfect tense or the Past Simple tense, ask yourself the questions \u2018When?'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "If you can answer the question \u2018When?', because the past time is stated or inferred or understood. There is no connection to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "If the you cannot answer the question \u2018When?', because the time is not stated or not important, then choose the Present Perfect tense. There is instead a connection to the present."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have never shared this story with anyone. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It has shaken me and left me with nightmares. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " I stumbled to my feet, glanced at the moon and scurried home."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I sat on some large rocks very close to the water's edge and contemplated my life."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to shake"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cause someone to feel fear, anxiety and shock"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It has shaken me and left me with nightmares. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le16ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in a narrative about a strange event."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pub"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building or room especially in Britain or Ireland where alcoholic drinks and often food are served"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  A party had been organized by my friends at a local pub but I had arrived too late. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le16ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to contemplate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to think deeply or carefully about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I sat on some large rocks very close to the water's edge and contemplated my life. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le16ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "disoriented"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "lost or confused"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I rubbed my eyes to wake up but felt disoriented.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le16ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "paralyzed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unable to do anything out of fear"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was paralyzed by the shocking site. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le16ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "menacing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "dangerous or possibly harmful"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The menacing, faceless animal moved closer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le16ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to latch on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to grab and hold"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It started to extend his arms to latch onto my legs.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le16ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to scurry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move quickly and with short steps"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I stumbled to my feet, glanced at the moon and scurried home."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le16ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Talk to your friends and family about a strange event or coincidence they have experienced."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take notes based on the conversation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Now, write a 150-170 word short narrative based on the notes you gathered."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You will need to include a: <ul><li>Narrator - the person or \u201cvoice\u201d telling the story to a reader</li><li>A setting - specific time and place the story is set:</li> <li>Characters - the people or animals in a story</li> <li>Plot -  a series of events that happen in the story - What happens?</li><li>A solution - the end of the plot, how the story finishes</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use both the Past tense and Present Perfect tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your narrative aloud to your friend or family member."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I discuss a strange event."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I take notes based on conversations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a short narrative about a strange event."}]}]}